{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for apples!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to tap your way to the top in <i>Applez</i>, a satisfying clicker game where every click brings you closer to the ultimate harvest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click apples to collect them, then trade up for rarer, shinier, and juicier apples! From Common to Mythic, each tier unlocks a new level of prestige. Whether you're grinding solo or trading with other players through the marketplace, the orchard is always full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive clicker gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade apples through exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading system to boost your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers to chase and brag about</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal apple events and limited-time items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How rare can your orchard grow? Start clicking and find out!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You clicked on apple 69 times.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/9bfac8f46028f445ce6106a814ef6a2d8bc82622.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 100 times.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/737ef287cc93e3c36a12f5679d8440be8d43fb67.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 500 times. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/bc476a28aa84af08b00944572c490e2732361eb4.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 1K times. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/d906ecb82f2b00481cdb847ff0c4ab8c7a08c085.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 5k times.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/b7723c5ba0697b0e4af43c719953612314e964e9.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 10k times.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/b5560c2072ed2f7f67a78fda62161adee652bb57.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 50k times.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/783d058df45f210b4387b64f918a527eecd9a795.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 100k times. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/486fc72423b94844de3a22a29fb63f700962eef2.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 500k times. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/af0535420c73ac1b888c7e35bfb2f41b13d58a38.jpg"},{"name":"You clicked on apple 1M times. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3742120/ca621634822ec22b940b4859a84395c945601dff.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742120?t=1757113565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742120/868ec2e6313758aedeae03754809621d1e047e7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757113565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742120/304094d8039481d344543f27203f0d58d3fbfe85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757113565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742120/304094d8039481d344543f27203f0d58d3fbfe85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757113565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon - Mythic apples are seasonal items. Harvest them while they are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >############################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular box</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >common - 84%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncommon - 14.9998989%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare - 1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >epic - 1 in 10 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >legendary - 1 in 1 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mythic - 1 in 10 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special box</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >common - 40%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncommon - 45%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare - 13.999989%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >epic - 1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >legendary - 1 in 100 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mythic - 1 in 1 000 000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >############################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop rates are subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability LVL rates and costs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handpicker 0.1 APS initial cost 1000 cost multiplier 1.05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer 0.4 APS initial cost 4000 cost multiplier 1.15</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honeybees 1.8 APS initial cost 18000 cost multiplier 1.25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantation 5 APS initial cost 50000 cost multiplier 1.35</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greenhouse 30 APS initial cost 150000 cost multiplier 1.45</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box Price Cost:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial cost 5000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cost increases by 100 each time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 12 boxes opened amount increasing is doubled every 12 openings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4f Join Our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want the inside scoop on <i>Hungry for Applez?</i> Come hang out with us on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find exclusive game insights, behind-the-scenes content, and sneak peeks at rare apple designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742120/extras/1c9a7ad6e9f5e4a0ebd4d701b18469e2.avif?t=1757113565\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for apples!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to tap your way to the top in <i>Applez</i>, a satisfying clicker game where every click brings you closer to the ultimate harvest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click apples to collect them, then trade up for rarer, shinier, and juicier apples! From Common to Mythic, each tier unlocks a new level of prestige. Whether you're grinding solo or trading with other players through the marketplace, the orchard is always full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive clicker gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade apples through exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading system to boost your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers to chase and brag about</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal apple events and limited-time items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How rare can your orchard grow? Start clicking and find out!</p>","developers":["R